    ],
    tableHead: { col1: 'Sector', col2: 'Location', col3: 'Notes' },
  },
  {
    heading: 'Gorilla Habituation Experience',
    body: [
      'In addition to the standard trek, the Rushaga sector of Bwindi offers the Gorilla Habituation Experience (GHEX). This allows you to spend up to 4 hours with a gorilla family that is still in the process of being habituated to human presence.',
